         <property name="html">
          <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:600; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI';&quot;&gt;Directions:    No collaboration!!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI';&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI';&quot;&gt;See the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;Exam 1 Study Guide&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI';&quot;&gt; for the list of approved resources.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;Use of any other resources will be considered cheating and will result in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI';&quot;&gt;zero credit (0 points) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;and additional penalties.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI';&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI';&quot;&gt;** When completing the tasks associated with each problem, you may only modify the files &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;dialog.h&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI';&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;dialog.cpp   &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;** Do NOT modify &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI';&quot;&gt;main.cpp &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI';&quot;&gt;dialog.ui &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;(the form) or you will receive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI';&quot;&gt; zero credit (0 points).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI';&quot;&gt;** Before you begin, review all problems and the grading rubric so that you may allocate appropriate time for each problem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI';&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI';&quot;&gt;The text browser object at the top of each tab descibes the desired task associated with that tab -- you may need to scroll down to read the complete description.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;Compare your work to the sample solution.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI';&quot;&gt;See Canvas for directions on how to execute a copy of the sample solution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI';&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; font-size:18pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;Your goal is to make your program's behavior match that of the sample solution (while conforming to specified constraints)!!!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:'Sans'; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#0617f3;&quot;&gt;When you are finished, upload both &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;dialog.h&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#0617f3;&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;dialog.cpp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#0617f3;&quot;&gt; as attachments to your Canvas dropbox submission.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;Be sure both files are attached to each submission you make.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;You may submit as many times as you wish.  I will only grade your final submission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;==&amp;gt; Your &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;final submission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt; must solve &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;ALL problems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt; to receive full credit. &amp;lt;==&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#ff0000;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;==&amp;gt; Be sure to verify that you submitted the correct files for grading. &amp;lt;==&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; font-style:italic; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;Submissions that do not compile will receive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; font-style:italic; color:#ef2929;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;zero credit (0 points).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; font-style:italic; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;Submissions by email will receive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; font-style:italic; color:#ef2929;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;zero credit (0 points).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; font-style:italic; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;Late submissions will receive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; font-style:italic; color:#ef2929;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;zero credit (0 points).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
